# `CLAUDE.md` is in the maintainer's global ignore file. This repository ships one on purpose — it is
# a three-line pointer at `AGENTS.md`, there so an agent working in a fresh clone is not left with
# nothing. A per-directory rule beats the global one, which is why this negation is here at all.
!CLAUDE.md

# Local working document — priority breakdown, not part of the published repo
PRIORITIES.md

# Written by `npm run bench:vs -- --outputJson`; the published table is regenerated, never committed raw.
bench-results.json
bench-results.*.json

# `docs-site/ru/` mirrors every English page so the language switcher can stay on the current one.
# Generated on predev/prebuild by scripts/generate-ru-mirrors.mjs; only the translated landing is
# written by hand and committed.
/docs-site/ru/*
!/docs-site/ru/index.md
